{"sections":[{"slug":"杨--Mills泛函","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"杨--Mills泛函"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">泛函</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“杨–Mills 泛函”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>, $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>. Yang–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">泛函是取值在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的泛函</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal L = \\|F\\|^2,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是联络对应的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/曲率","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\|-\\|$ <span lang=\"zh\">来源于</span> $\\Omega^2(M,\\mathfrak g)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个内积</span>.</p>\n<p>$$\r\nS=\\int \\mathcal L \\,\\text{dVol} = -\\int F\\wedge\\star F\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">规范不变性</span></h2>\n<p>“<span lang=\"zh\">完美</span> Morse <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>”</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">其临界点为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/杨--Mills联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">与全纯向量丛的联系</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">辛几何与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/动量映射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">动量映射</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">将杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">泛函与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全纯向量丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全纯向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">联系起来</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">杨</span>–Mills <span lang=\"zh\">理论可用于研究丛的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}